        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792488723
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> uweigand created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14883#discussion_r4323505638\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This isn't wrong, but I don't see why it is necessary - the <code>fpromote_reg</code> rule itself already rejects all unsupported type combinations ...</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 633259961,
