    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> ilyas-mallah created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14883#discussion_r4324173283\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Same reason, see my reply above. <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/fa20b4c09b3002afb1b20eb5a3385c28a4290d63/cranelift/codegen/src/isa/s390x/inst.isle#L4942-L4949\"><code>fdemote_reg</code></a> isn't <code>partial</code> either, and <code>fdemote.f16</code> of an f32 value panics in it with \"no rule matched for term fdemote_reg\".</p>\n</blockquote>",
